  "body": "Main was red after the 2026-11-12 merge run. Test-side only; no product code touched.\n\n1. `crates/app/src/operation/rotary_law_tests.rs:27`: `verify::Cutter` literal lacked `neck` (added by #957). Fix: `neck: None` (the \"no neck\" value, as the other fixtures).\n2. 8 recorded refusals in `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/tormach-plasma/` (arcs, drill_retract, empty_section, extreme_coords, full_circle, full_circle_raw, probe, tool_change) held the old sentence; #1049 reworded it. Each diff is one line: `- no machine is not declared a plasma machine` -> `- no machine is stated, so none is declared a plasma machine` (8 files, 8+/8-, nothing else moved; hand edit).\n\nRun green: camcraft-post (all suites, script_tormach_plasma 9/9), camcraft-app --lib 138, camcraft-sim (all suites), camcraft-motion --lib 195 (1 ignored), camcraft-ui --lib 562 (5 ignored), clippy app/post/sim --all-targets -D warnings. `cargo test -p camcraft-app --no-run` compiles all targets. Not exercised: camcraft-kernel, app integration test binaries (compile only).\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1146\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
